      "status": "completed",
      "finalText": "It's set up and switched on. From now on, everyone who submits the **Contact Us** form (`frm_001`) goes straight into the **New Lead Nurture** workflow (`wf_001`).\n\n- **What I used:** There was already a trigger for this, **Contact Us Form Submitted** (`trg_004`). It was switched off and not linked to any workflow. Rather than make a duplicate, I linked it to New Lead Nurture and turned it on.\n- **When it runs:** Any time a form is submitted and the form name is \"Contact Us\".\n- **What happens next:** The workflow sends a text, waits a day, then sends an email. If they still haven't replied, it creates a \"Call new lead\" task for the next day.\n\n**Watch out for:** The workflow starts with a text message. A recent run for `con_008` failed at that first step because the contact had opted out of texts. The same could happen to form submitters who opt out.",
